-- Reorder diagnostic_questions pedagogically and add 39 new questions.
-- Deletes all existing questions for diagnostic 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001;
-- cascade-deletes orphan diagnostic_results (acceptable for pilot stage).

begin;

